hosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":21,"end":21,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":37,"end":37,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":38,"end":38,"description":"Phosphothreonine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":55,"end":55,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":75,"end":75,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":94,"end":94,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":144,"end":988,"description":""},{"type":"Site","start":719,"end":720,"description":"Breakpoint for translocation to form ERC1-RET oncogene"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1005,"end":1005,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1046,"end":1046,"description":"Phosphothreonine"},{"type":"Domain","start":1046,"end":1108,"description":"FIP-RBD"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":1060,"end":1100,"description":""}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Part of a complex with CHUK, IKBKB and IKBKG. Interacts with CHUK, IKBKB and IKBKG. The interaction with IKBKG is independent of CHUK and IKBKB. Interacts with NFKBIA. Isoform 4 interacts with PPFIA1, and through its C-terminus with the PDZ domains of RIMS1 and RIMS2. Interacts with ERC2/CAST1. Interacts with the GTB-bound forms of RAB6A isoform 1 and isoform 2 and with RAB6B. The interaction was strongest with RAB6B, followed by RAB6A isoform 2 and weakest with RAB6A isoform 1 (By similarity). Interacts with SDCCAG8. Part of a cortical microtubule stabilization complex (CMSC) composed of KANK1, PPFIA1, PPFIBP1, ERC1/ELKS, PHLDB2/LL5beta, CLASPs, KIF21A and possibly additional interactors; within CMSCs KANK1 and PHLDB2/LL5beta appear to be the core components for targeting of microtubule-binding proteins KIF21A and CLASPs, whereas PPFIA1, PPFIBP1 and ERC1/ELKS serve as scaffolds for protein clustering. Interacts (via N-terminus) with SRPK1 (via kinase domain) and SRPK2 (via kinase domain); the interaction is direct and may be involved in SRPK protein localization (By similarity)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q8IUD2-2","name":"2","synonyms":["ELKS beta"],"notes":[{"topic":"Miscellaneous","text":"May be produced at very low levels due to a premature stop codon in the mRNA, leading to nonsense-mediated mRNA decay"}],"length":992,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000440394.7"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":["ENST00000440394.7"],"onlyDecay":true},"segments":[[1,1,439],[440,468,316],[760,784,225]],"edits":[{"start":440,"end":467,"original":"VEQLKEELSSKEAQWEELKKKAAGLQAE","replacement":"","added":0},{"start":783,"end":783,"original":"E","replacement":"ESLTS","added":5},{"start":1009,"end":1116,"original":"IIQPLLELDQNRSKLKLYIGHLTTLCHDRDPLILRGLTPP","replacement":"DEEEGIWA","added":8}],"missing":136,"replaced":0,"novel":12,"foldedAbsent":131,"foldedMissing":131,"features":[[8,28,0],[11,1,0],[12,63,0],[13,41,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q8IUD2-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q8IUD2-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":74.8,"plddt":[[0,137],[50,2],[70,11],[90,30],[70,9],[50,2],[70,7],[90,36],[70,2],[90,1],[70,7],[50,3],[0,15],[50,4],[70,8],[90,2],[70,1],[90,27],[70,1],[90,3],[70,7],[50,4],[0,3],[50,6],[70,13],[90,1],[70,2],[90,2],[70,1],[90,2],[70,1],[90,4],[70,10],[50,14],[70,1],[50,1],[70,17],[50,1],[70,6],[50,6],[0,5],[50,8],[70,2],[50,1],[70,8],[90,145],[70,2],[90,1],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,6],[70,1],[90,33],[70,1],[90,2],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,3],[70,3],[90,2],[70,17],[50,1],[70,1],[50,1],[70,1],[50,2],[70,1],[50,1],[70,3],[50,1],[70,6],[50,1],[70,4],[50,9],[0,16],[50,3],[70,46],[50,33],[70,2],[50,1],[70,15],[90,81],[70,1],[90,2],[70,2],[90,2],[70,1],[90,3],[70,1],[90,21],[70,6],[50,1],[70,1],[50,1],[70,8],[90,20],[70,6],[50,8],[0,12],[50,1],[0,10]],"losingConfidence":2}},{"accession":"Q8IUD2-3","name":"3","synonyms":["ELKS delta"],"notes":[],"length":1088,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000